<td>&nbsp;
<p>The following is a list of majors and their requirements to earn an Associate in Arts degree at Lake Tahoe Community College. Students need to complete one of the majors listed below and the <a href="https://ltcc.elumenapp.com/catalog/2023-2024/general-education-patterns#mainContent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AA General Education Pattern</a> to earn an AA degree. Students must complete 90 quarter units to receive an Associate in Arts degree.</p>
<p>Please note that all courses used to satisfy the major for the Associate in Arts degree must be completed with a grade of "C" or better.</p>
<ul>
<li><a title="Addiction Studies" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/addiction_studies.php">Addiction Studies</a></li>
<li><a title="Anthropology" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/anthropology.php">Anthropology</a></li>
<li><a title="Art" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/art.php">Art</a></li>
<li><a title="Art New Media" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/art.php">Art New Media</a></li>
<li><a title="Business" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/business.php">Business</a></li>
<li><a title="Cybersecurity" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/cybersecurity.php">Computer and Information Sciences - Cybersecurity</a></li>
<li><a title="Criminal Justice" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/criminaljustice.php">Criminal Justice</a></li>
<li><a title="Culinary Arts" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/culinaryarts.php">Culinary Arts</a></li>
<li><a title="Early Childhood Education" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/earlychildhoodeducation.php">Early Childhood Education</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/science/evs_ets.php">Environmental Science &amp; Technology</a></li>
<li><a title="Fire Academy" href="{{f:10625702}}">Fire Academy</a></li>
<li><a title="Fire Officer" href="{{f:10625703}}">Fire Officer</a></li>
<li><a title="Fire Science" href="{{f:11107518}}">Fire Science</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/forestry.php">Forestry</a></li>
<li><a title="Liberal Arts" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/liberal_arts.php">Liberal Arts</a></li>
<li><a title="Medical Office Assistant" href="{{f:10625726}}">Medical Office Assistant</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/socialscience/">Social Science</a></li>
<li><a title="Wilderness Education &amp; Outdoor Leadership" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/wildernessed.php">Wilderness Education&nbsp;&amp; Outdoor Leadership</a></li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>&nbsp;
